    "Purchases are processed by RevenueCat and Apple's App Store. We receive your subscription status (active, trial, expired) but never your payment details - Apple handles those directly." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Käufe werden von RevenueCat und dem Apple App Store abgewickelt. Wir erhalten deinen Abonnementstatus (aktiv, Testphase, abgelaufen), aber niemals deine Zahlungsdaten - diese verwaltet Apple direkt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purchases are processed by RevenueCat and Apple's App Store. We receive your subscription status (active, trial, expired) but never your payment details - Apple handles those directly."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las compras son procesadas por RevenueCat y la App Store de Apple. Recibimos el estado de tu suscripción (activa, prueba, caducada) pero nunca tus datos de pago - Apple los gestiona directamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les achats sont traités par RevenueCat et l'App Store d'Apple. Nous recevons le statut de votre abonnement (actif, essai, expiré) mais jamais vos coordonnées de paiement - Apple s'en occupe directement."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "購入はRevenueCatとApple App Storeによって処理されます。サブスクリプションの状態(有効、トライアル中、期限切れ)は取得しますが、お支払い情報は一切取得しません - それはAppleが直接管理します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "구매는 RevenueCat과 Apple App Store를 통해 처리됩니다. 저희는 구독 상태(활성, 체험, 만료)만 받으며 결제 정보는 절대 받지 않습니다 - 이는 Apple이 직접 처리합니다."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zakupy są przetwarzane przez RevenueCat i App Store firmy Apple. Otrzymujemy status Twojej subskrypcji (aktywna, próbna, wygasła), ale nigdy dane płatności - Apple obsługuje je bezpośrednio."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As compras são processadas pela RevenueCat e pela App Store da Apple. Recebemos o status da sua assinatura (ativa, teste, expirada), mas nunca seus dados de pagamento - a Apple cuida disso diretamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "购买由 RevenueCat 和 Apple App Store 处理。我们只会收到你的订阅状态（有效、试用中、已过期），绝不会收到你的付款信息——这些由 Apple 直接处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Questions about this policy? Reach out from the FAQ section in Settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fragen zu dieser Richtlinie? Wende dich über den FAQ-Bereich in den Einstellungen an uns."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questions about this policy? Reach out from the FAQ section in Settings."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Preguntas sobre esta política? Contáctanos desde la sección de preguntas frecuentes en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Des questions sur cette politique ? Contactez-nous depuis la section FAQ dans les Réglages."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このポリシーについて質問がありますか?設定内のFAQセクションからお問い合わせください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 정책에 대해 궁금한 점이 있나요? 설정의 FAQ 섹션에서 문의해주세요."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Masz pytania dotyczące tej polityki? Skontaktuj się z nami w sekcji FAQ w Ustawieniach."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
